  "code": "/* Example: Counting non-digits in the stream of text */\n\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid main() {\n    int ch;\n    int nondig = 0;\n\n    /* Accumulating counters in the loop */\n    while ((ch = getchar()) != EOF)\n        if (! (ch >= '0' && ch <= '9'))\n            nondig++;\n\n    /* Printing results */\n    printf(\"Numbers of non-digits is %d:\\n\", nondig);\n}",
